      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transport Lucknow Insured</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">
<h3>1. Self-attested RC Photocopy</h3>
<p>The Road Transport Corporation (RTC) registration certificate (RC) is a crucial document for bike transport. A self-attested copy of the RC provides proof of ownership and allows for smooth registration at the destination. Ensure that the RC copy is clear, legible, and has been signed by you.</p>

<h3>2. Current PUC</h3>
<p>To transport your bike legally, it is necessary to have a Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate. The PUC verifies that the vehicle meets environmental standards and is in good condition. Make sure to obtain a valid PUC certificate before the transport.</p>

<h3>3. Valid Insurance Certificate</h3>
<p>Insurance coverage is essential for bike transport to protect both you and the transporter in case of any damage or accident during the journey. A valid insurance certificate ensures that any losses or damages are covered. Ensure that the insurance policy is up-to-date and covers the entire transportation process.</p>

<h3>4. IBA-Approved Consignment Bill</h3>
<p>The Insurance Brokers Association of India (IBA) has approved a standard consignment bill for bike transport. This document serves as a contract between you and the transporter, outlining the details of the transport, including the bike's make, model, color, and condition. Make sure to obtain an IBA-approved consignment bill from the transporter beforehand.</p>

<h3>5. 100% Declared-Value Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
<p>In case of any damage or loss during transportation, a marine transit insurance ensures financial compensation. Opting for a 100% declared-value insurance policy ensures that you receive the full value of your bike in case of any damages. This insurance covers the bike's total value, providing peace of mind during the transport process.</p>

<h3>Important Documents to Carry During Transport</h3>
<p>While the above-mentioned documents are crucial for the transport process, it is also essential to carry the following documents:</p>

